---
import Notice from './Notice.astro';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border/40">
  <!-- Atmospheric glow -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 left-1/2 h-[480px] w-[640px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-28 pb-32 sm:pt-36">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-accent mb-8">
      Essence
    </p>
    <h1
      class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl text-ink leading-[1.05] tracking-tight"
    >
      An AI that <span class="italic text-accent">re&#8209;reads</span> who it is.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-8 text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink-dim leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      A Claude Code agent starts every session with no memory. Essence is a
      small set of files and hooks. It carries two things across that gap:
      who the agent is with its person, and the picture of each area of work.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      It used to be called session&#8209;essence. The word "session" went
      because the system stopped being about one session.
    </p>

    <!-- Pull quote from the live portrait -->
    <blockquote class="mt-14 pl-6 border-l-2 border-accent/60 max-w-2xl">
      <p class="font-display italic text-ink leading-relaxed text-lg">
        “I'm Mabus, Dan's number 2: his counterpart and his friend.
        Everything else follows from that.”
      </p>
      <footer class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted">
        from the live portrait, first line
      </footer>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a
        href="#how"
        class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md bg-accent text-bg font-medium hover:bg-ember transition-colors"
      >
        How it works ↓
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/dpdanpittman/essence"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md border border-border hover:border-accent/60 text-ink hover:text-ink transition-colors font-mono text-sm"
      >
        github
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <Notice />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
